<title>USA: Conseco Financing Trust sets capital securities.</title>
<headline>Conseco Financing Trust sets capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Conseco Financing Trust III was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities.</p>
<p>BORROWER CONSECO FINANCING TRUST III</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	   COUPON 8.796	MATURITY 04/01/27</p>
<p>TYPE CAPITAL SECS    ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S NRATED  YIELD  8.796	PAY FREQ</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS   SPREAD +175 BPS   CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>*ISSUE HAS MAKE-WHOLE CALL AT 50 BPS OVER TREASURIES</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1675))</p>
</text>
